        <description>{
&quot;agentName&quot;: &quot;Court Decision Prediction Agent (CDPA)&quot;,
&quot;agentDescription&quot;: &quot;Utilizes predictive analytics, natural language processing (NLP) on historical case law, judgments, and relevant legal precedents to forecast potential court decisions (e.g., by NCLT/NCLAT under IBC). Aims to provide probabilistic insights into potential outcomes, identify influential factors, and offer data-informed perspectives to support strategic case preparation and argumentation. *This agent provides analytical s…</description>
    </item>
